---
title: "syncDiscordRoles (stem-system teams.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_config: apiUrl = env.STEM_BOT_API_URL, token = env.STEM_BOT_API_BEARER_TOKEN
    q_load_config --> q_check_config: check apiUrl and token
    q_check_config --> q_abort: apiUrl == null or token == null
    q_check_config --> q_fetch: apiUrl != null and token != null
    q_abort --> [*]: return (silent failure)
    q_fetch --> q_check_response: res = fetch(apiUrl + "/api/roles/sync", POST, Bearer token, discord_uid)
    q_check_response --> q_error_response: res.ok == false
    q_check_response --> [*]: res.ok == true (sync initiated)
    q_error_response --> [*]: log error and return
    q_fetch --> q_catch: fetch throws exception
    q_catch --> [*]: log error and return

    note right of q_fetch
        INV-001: Bearer token is sent in Authorization header for every sync request
        INV-002: Request body contains only discord_uid as JSON
        INV-003: Function never throws; all errors are caught and logged
    end note
